  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/394/948/banner_amethyst.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/9UVGJGyqbv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/993245467162972220?color=blue&amp;label=Discord&amp;style=plastic&amp;logo=discord\" width=\"191\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/exlinegames/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Curseforge-Projects-blue?style=plastic&amp;logo=curseforge\" width=\"226\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fexline\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-Profle-blue?style=plastic&amp;logo=modrinth\" width=\"185\" height=\"28\"></a></span></strong></span></span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/475/742/amethyst_horizontal_line.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong>Экипировка из аметиста</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Этот мод добавляет инструменты, меч, доспехи и конскую броню из аметиста.</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Аметист на самом деле очень легко получить, поэтому я сделал так, чтобы инструменты и доспехи быстро ломались, но они по-прежнему остаются прочными.</span>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Прочность - 44<br></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Эффективность - 15</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Урон от атаки - 0,5</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Возможность заклинания инструментов - 1</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Рейтинги брони - 4 (2,5,6,2)<br></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Возможность заклинания брони - 8</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Рейтинг брони для лошадей - 4</span></li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Используйте аметистовый осколок как слиток для изготовления снаряжения.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Вы не можете переработать свое аметистовое снаряжение.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/475/742/amethyst_horizontal_line.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\">Скачать</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/amethyst-equipment/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:7498\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/408/905/forgeicon.png\"></span></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/amethyst-equipment/files/4068246\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-1.19.2-brightgreen?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"138\" height=\"30\"></a><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/amethyst-equipment/files/3843031\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.19-green?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"57\" height=\"30\"></strong></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/amethyst-equipment/files/3790662\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.18.2-yellowgreen?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"72\" height=\"30\"></strong></a></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/amethyst-equipment/files/3543406\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.18.1-yellow?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"72\" height=\"30\"></strong></a></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/amethyst-equipment/files/3432801\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.17.1-orange?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"72\" height=\"30\"></strong></a></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/amethyst-equipment/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:7499\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/408/904/fabricicon.png\"></a></span>&nbsp;</p>\n\nСодержание посвящено модам, ресурспакам, модпакам, шейдерпакам или другим ресурсам для Minecraft. Пожалуйста, сохраняйте стиль языка приятным для геймеров.<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/amethyst-equipment/files/4508916\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric-1.19.4-blue?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"146\" height=\"30\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/amethyst-equipment/files/4385279\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.19.3-teal?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"71\" height=\"30\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/amethyst-equipment/files/4062537\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.19.2-brightgreen?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"71\" height=\"30\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/amethyst-equipment/files/3874